  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845850,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: Blood Stone - Nintendo DS Synopsis\n\nStep into the world of espionage as James Bond in *James Bond 007: Blood Stone* for the Nintendo DS! This thrilling third-person shooter, the 24th installment in the iconic Bond series, delivers an original story featuring the likenesses and voices of Daniel Craig, Judi Dench, and Joss Stone.\n\nEmbark on a globe-trotting adventure, utilizing the DS's unique features for intuitive gameplay. Engage in cover-based shooting, intense hand-to-hand combat, and high-octane driving sequences across stunning locations like Athens, Istanbul, Monaco, and Bangkok.  Experience the life of a 00 agent as you unravel a dangerous plot.\n\nWhile retaining the core Bond experience, *Blood Stone* offers a robust multiplayer mode, allowing you to test your skills and teamwork against other players in thrilling 16-person battles.  Prepare for a pulse-pounding adventure filled with intrigue, action, and the signature style of James Bond, all optimized for the Nintendo DS."
    },
